                                @((MarkupString)$""<line x1=\""{startX}\"" y1=\""{gy}\"" x2=\""{startX + totalBarWidth}\"" y2=\""{gy}\"" stroke=\""currentColor\"" stroke-opacity=\""0.1\"" stroke-width=\""1\""/>"")
                                @((MarkupString)$""<text x=\""{startX - 4}\"" y=\""{gy + 4}\"" text-anchor=\""end\"" font-size=\""9\"" fill=\""currentColor\"" fill-opacity=\""0.5\"">${yVal}k</text>"")
                            }
                            @* Bars + X-axis labels *@
                            @for (int bi = 0; bi < _revenueData.Length; bi++)
                            {
                                var rd = _revenueData[bi];
                                var barH = (int)(availH * rd.Revenue / maxRev);
                                var bx = startX + bi * (barW + gap);
                                var by = padTop + availH - barH;
                                var labelY = chartH - 4;
                                @((MarkupString)$""<rect x=\""{bx}\"" y=\""{by}\"" width=\""{barW}\"" height=\""{barH}\"" rx=\""4\"" ry=\""4\"" fill=\""var(--chart-1, hsl(var(--primary)))\""/>"")
